  <TITLE>Genome-wide CRISPR Screens in Primary Human T Cells Reveal Key Regulators of Immune Function</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We established a platform to perform pooled CRISPR screen in primary human T cells. We applied this platform to explore regulators of T cell activation and stimulation.</DESCRIPTION>
